{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "8081558a0e2d36d76c071738a8d55e448f7fd25579d575f8f6fd5e7e3ecd2319", "ja": "1、2……3！　……マジック、成功です。\nけど、これだけでは……ううん。", "zh": "1、2……3！……魔术成功了。\n可是，光是这样还……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "0ee4188f4b6e82ad8a3ff84563c805295c941d9e0bf85651dc6a785bccfa429c", "ja": "瑞希お姉さま……？\nこんなところで、何してるの……？", "zh": "瑞希姐姐……？\n你在这种地方做什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "2dba9a89e8490bf9b72202f2ef7a95c113230ecc5d03d906406f6f2fe55275af", "ja": "ごきげんよう、望月さん。今、卒業パーティーの\nステージで披露するマジックを考えていたところです。", "zh": "您好，望月同学。我刚才正在考虑要在毕业派对的舞台上表演的魔术。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "f2c71f7c94472e53e4db179d7765f54f74b5ae586aa8acaa1f10c3e91d957fc3", "ja": "卒業パーティー……まつりお姉さま、\nもうすぐ、卒業しちゃうんだよね。寂しいな……。", "zh": "毕业派对……小祭姐姐，马上就要毕业了呢。好寂寞啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "0cc66b1f905d0bda9495ece2e4f4605af4b2696c8764b0b0bbe26fa243d5124c", "ja": "そうですね。ですが、寂しいからこそ。\n最後は笑顔で、お姉さまを送り出したいと思うのです。", "zh": "是啊。不过正因为不舍，所以最后我想带着笑容送姐姐踏上新的旅程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "646eff6b73e3094d0eaa4e60568bbe4227e64d041b26e2940b9c913f88473b83", "ja": "お姉さまを、心から笑顔にするためにも……望月さん。\nあなたも、ステージに参加してくれませんか？", "zh": "为了让姐姐发自内心地露出笑容……望月小姐。你也愿意参加演出吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "cc7706ba79b22d671d9ab03eee2a0b14c8b5c7b261402fb9fcca55d865210668", "ja": "瑞希お姉さま……うん！　杏奈も、手伝う。\nふたりで、まつりお姉さまをビックリさせようね……！", "zh": "瑞希姐姐……嗯！杏奈也来帮忙。我们一起给茉莉姐姐一个惊喜吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "1214464917f1cba4db146ae3917ff0bebff5ec941cd316829309a340369aa460", "ja": "……うん。やっぱり、次のミス・ダリアは\nあなたに相応しいわ。瑞希ちゃん。", "zh": "……嗯。下一任大丽花小姐，\n果然还是非你莫属呢。瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "4ce58e0ae671d3586c07daa4cb1f51cf8e7baec0cb31cdacf6f17cdfc9c6f6b0", "ja": "まつりは何も見ていないし、聞いていない。\nかわいい妹たちに見つかる前に、退散なのです。", "zh": "茉莉什么都没看见，也什么都没听到。\n在被可爱的妹妹们发现之前，先退散啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "0e5854318a4d1e603573efabfeaaa95307157b6237590b59b0e16010e83bf419", "ja": "はいほー！　{$P$}さん、\n姫たちのお芝居、どうだったのです？", "zh": "嗨哟——！{$P$}先生，\n公主们的演出怎么样呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1011_p", "source_sha256": "66b5649008e69c7c968af7ff3d2adfa5b7056e418563fe36e6033f01c89d9a38", "ja": "3人とも、お疲れさま！　ああ、すごくよかったよ……\nって、瑞希？　杏奈も、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "你们3个，辛苦了！啊，演得非常棒哦……\n话说，瑞希？杏奈也怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "fedf78d9aa973715663d00dd6ef2490f9aa9bd88794b667d10a82ed2b2266ba6", "ja": "いえ。徳川お姉さまが卒業すると思ったら、\nなんだか寂しくなってしまって……。", "zh": "没事的。一想到德川学姐要毕业了，\n就总觉得有些寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "f00ad9bce37c8c44a327015ca9b30af4a49292eb15961096fe3bba0326424602", "ja": "徳川さんも、徳川お姉さまのように……\nいつか、アイドルを卒業してしまうのでしょうか。", "zh": "德川小姐也会像德川学姐那样……\n总有一天，也会从偶像毕业吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "e040aebbcb3d7fc8cbda2e1fed49fbe516044db7a09720c9c74dd18e5741a5fc", "ja": "え……まつりさん、アイドルやめちゃうの？\n杏奈、さみしい……。", "zh": "诶……まつり姐也要放弃偶像吗？\n杏奈会寂寞的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "f04dca5b05596a6529bdc50d9da333c6847f405c787917d53eb8c98fd0ae0ce3", "ja": "ほ？　ふたりして、\nまつりを卒業させないでほしいのですー！", "zh": "诶？你们两个，不要让小祭毕业啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d6320d06380517f47f95adb444cdc752d7cc87f5f1c3b01ee63d8fd6fa89947d", "ja": "はは、そうだな。アイドルを卒業するかどうかは、\n本人が決める事だけど……。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。要不要从偶像毕业，\n还是由本人决定的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ba062309f091c8a4432610cb232f79dd244b6c9fa8cf6e33612a5063d92b72b9", "ja": "アイドル自身がやりたいと思っているうちは、\n俺はどこまでも応援するよ！", "zh": "只要偶像自己还想继续，我就会一直支持下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "54dd21b801e6c41e3f9a781bb1c4c9886bf978af10792ff79d6a7be33ce24e27", "ja": "{$P$}さんの言うとおりなのです。\nみんなアイドルを卒業なんて、100年早いのです！", "zh": "正如{$P$}先生所说。\n大家要从偶像毕业，可还早了100年呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "263a36b0660d335ad7f1cba232534ff004a3ab690182d572a8f40aba11e3ffda", "ja": "まつりさん……うん。\n杏奈、これからもアイドル……がんばり、ます♪", "zh": "茉莉……嗯。  \n杏奈今后也会继续努力……成为偶像♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "ed36691f563ac57504af399c6e50bd5219499ba1edb4917cad32d3c6239fa7c0", "ja": "私たちのアイドル道は、これからということですね。\nやるぞ、瑞希。……メラメラ。", "zh": "我们的偶像之路，从现在才真正开始呢。\n加油，瑞希。……斗志熊熊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "15d498e38dd0b96b13c673fd731c1c95125c1e52ff5264b6c55669139a8be432", "ja": "その意気なのです。では、特別に……\n良い子のふたりに、姫がご褒美をあげるのです。", "zh": "就是要有这样的气势。那么，特别地……公主给两个乖孩子奖励哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "237e2213d00459b4fefeef0c66f2df00199af739c5dc864e197398d79bbd2c05", "ja": "次のシーンの撮影が始まるまで、\nミス・ダリアのお茶会にご招待なのです♪", "zh": "在下个场景开始拍摄之前，特别邀请你们参加达莉娅小姐的茶会♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "cf4dc5167565292ea6d3ac7634fd5afeb3896e87e3b4332eccbb68bbc09353ab", "ja": "まつりさんのお茶会……楽しみ、です……♪　行こう、\n瑞希さん……{$P$}さんも……♪", "zh": "茉莉小姐的茶会……好期待……♪ 我们走吧，瑞希小姐……还有{$P$}先生也一起……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "3d140cd9714874465c02edd879f8a4ab54c1701ddf488d38104a3574aaef4f60", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……素敵な思い出が、またひとつ増えそうです。", "zh": "谢谢。\n……美好的回忆，感觉又要增添一份了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0254_1025_p", "source_sha256": "abb02f12149421fca15d563b9494216bd56f8483d5de2c45b02ccce78140c0e4", "ja": "（少しだけ不器用な3人が見せる、姉妹の姿……\n相手を思いやる、優しい物語になりそうだ）", "zh": "（稍显笨拙的3人展现出的姐妹模样……看来会是个体贴对方的温柔故事。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
